<title>JAPAN: Okayamaken Freight to issue 3 bln yen CB.</title>
<headline>Okayamaken Freight to issue 3 bln yen CB.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Okayamaken Freight Transportation Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities Co Ltd</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Chugoku Bank Ltd</p>
<p> TYPE convertible     ISSUE NO   1	  AMT   3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON		   ISS PRICE	     MATURITY 31.Mar.04</p>
<p> CONV PRICE	     CURR RATE</p>
<p> CONV FROM 3.Feb.97   CONV TO 30.Mar.04</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 19.Dec.96  INT PAY end Mar/Sep</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 12.Dec-18.Dec</p>
<p> LAST JCR   BBB-	LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
<p>The coupon and conversion price will be decided on December 11.</p>
</text>
